    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love ragdolls and I love physics, so I thought I would mush the two together with a level editor and make a cool sandbox game for people to play around in. Currently, there is a very basic JSON-based level editor and 30 pre-built levels. I am in the process of adding more items to the sandbox and would like to get community feedback and hopefully grow the game into something really fun.<br><br>UPDATE: Now with pinball items. So you can make ragdoll based pinball tables.</p>",
